First item written, then the second item hits a directory where SKILL.md should be → EISDIR aborts before the lock is persisted. After the obstacle is removed, the retry reports conflicts on skilletor's own earlier output (probe 07). Code: src/apply.ts:144-168, 218-222. Fix: pre-check file types, persist ownership so a retry can resume.

Repro: probe file by the skilletor-71 audit session, copied to docs-free scratch; reproduced by the orchestrator against exports of e371b13 AND v0.2.0 (pre-existing, not introduced by k62/k63/k65).

